! spoke3 — DMVPN Phase 3 spoke  (Arista EOS)
!
! Physical IPs and Tunnel0 base are pre-configured.
! YOUR TASK: Configure NHRP + OSPF point-to-point + ip nhrp shortcut.
!
! -------------------------------------------------------
! Phase 3 spoke configuration:
!
! Step 1 — Configure NHRP and OSPF on Tunnel0:
!   configure
!   interface Tunnel0
!      ip nhrp network-id 1
!      ip nhrp holdtime 300
!      ip nhrp nhs 172.16.0.1 nbma 10.0.0.1 multicast
!      ip nhrp map 172.16.0.1 10.0.0.1
!      ip nhrp shortcut
!      ip ospf network point-to-point
!      ip ospf area 0
!
! Step 2 — Configure OSPF process:
!   router ospf 1
!      router-id 10.0.0.13
!      passive-interface Loopback0
!      passive-interface Loopback1
!
! Step 3 — Verify Phase 3 operation:
!   show ip route 192.168.0.0/16        <- summary via hub (172.16.0.1)
!   show ip route 192.168.1.0           <- before shortcut: via hub; after: via 172.16.0.11
!   ping 192.168.1.1 repeat 100         <- first packets via hub, then shortcut kicks in
!   show ip nhrp shortcut               <- shortcut entries installed by NHRP
!   show ip nhrp                        <- dynamic entry with 'shortcut' flag for spoke1/2
!   traceroute 192.168.1.1              <- direct path after shortcut resolves
!
! Phase 3 insight:
!   Before shortcut:
!     Routing table: 192.168.0.0/16 via 172.16.0.1 (hub — OSPF summary)
!     All spoke-to-spoke traffic transits hub
!
!   After sending first packet to another spoke's LAN:
!     Hub sends NHRP redirect with the target spoke's tunnel + NBMA IP
!     Routing table gains a /24 shortcut route (MORE SPECIFIC than /16)
!     Subsequent packets bypass hub entirely
!
! NHRP parameters for this spoke:
!   NHS tunnel IP:  172.16.0.1    NHS NBMA IP:  10.0.0.1
!   Our tunnel IP:  172.16.0.13   Our NBMA IP:  10.0.0.13
! -------------------------------------------------------
!
hostname spoke3
!
interface Loopback0
   ip address 10.0.0.13/32
!
interface Loopback1
   description Simulated LAN behind spoke3
   ip address 192.168.3.1/24
!
interface Ethernet1
   description WAN NBMA network (10.0.0.0/24)
   no switchport
   ip address 10.0.0.13/24
   no shutdown
!
interface Tunnel0
   description DMVPN mGRE tunnel
   tunnel source Ethernet1
   tunnel mode gre multipoint
   ip address 172.16.0.13/24
   no shutdown
   ! YOUR TASK: Add NHRP + OSPF point-to-point + ip nhrp shortcut (see hints above)
!
ip routing
!
end
